          <code>utf8_validation = NONE</code> on any <code>string</code> field (singular, repeated,
          oneof, or map key/value), non-zero <code>[default = ...]</code> values (including{' '}
          <code>-0.0</code> and non-zero enum defaults), and non-option extensions.
        </p>
